{"seq":3,"slug":"differential-privacy","title":"差分隐私合成：给隐私上数学锁","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/synthetic-data-generation/tabular/differential-privacy","wordCount":1448,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"差分隐私合成-给隐私上数学锁\">差分隐私合成：给隐私上数学锁</h1><p>&quot;我们的数据是合成的，所以隐私安全&quot;——这句话在 2026 年已经站不住脚。多篇研究表明，未加保护的合成器会记住并泄露训练集里的稀有个体，成员推断攻击能以远高于随机的成功率判断某人是否在训练集中（来源：arxiv.org/2507.17066《Benchmarking Privacy Leakage of Foundation Models in Synthetic Tabular Data》）。要让&quot;合成即隐私&quot;这个承诺真正成立，需要形式化保证，这就是差分隐私（DP）。本篇讲 DP 的定义、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span> 预算、两条主流训练路线、以及为何在小预算下经典的基于边缘的方法常打败深度模型。</p>\n<p>DP 兑现了 <a href=\"../foundations/fidelity-utility-privacy\">保真-效用-隐私三角</a> 里&quot;隐私&quot;顶点的形式化承诺。它把模糊的&quot;隐私保护&quot;变成一个可证明、可量化、可组合的数学性质，这是它区别于所有启发式脱敏的根本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-差分隐私的定义与预算\">核心概念：差分隐私的定义与预算</h2><p>一个随机机制 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>ϵ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>δ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(\\epsilon,\\delta)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>-差分隐私，若对任意仅相差一条记录的相邻数据集 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mi>D</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D,D&#x27;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9463em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和任意输出集合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Pr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>M</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∈</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>≤</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>ϵ</mi></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mi>Pr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>M</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>D</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∈</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Pr[M(D)\\in S] \\le e^{\\epsilon}\\cdot\\Pr[M(D&#x27;)\\in S] + \\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">Pr</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0519em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">Pr</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>直觉是：<strong>任何单个个体在不在数据集里，都不会显著改变输出的概率分布</strong>，因此攻击者无法从输出反推某人是否参与。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span> 是隐私预算，越小隐私越强、注入噪声越多；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> 是允许这个保证被打破的极小概率。DP 有两个关键性质让它能工程化：<strong>后处理免疫</strong>（对 DP 输出做任何不碰原数据的处理仍是 DP）与<strong>可组合</strong>（多个 DP 步骤的预算可累加计算）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  D[真实数据集] --&gt; R{DP 训练路线}&#10;  R --&gt;|梯度加噪| A[DP-SGD&lt;br/&gt;裁剪+高斯噪声]&#10;  R --&gt;|教师投票| B[PATE&lt;br/&gt;集成+加噪聚合]&#10;  R --&gt;|边缘加噪| C[PrivBayes/MST/AIM&lt;br/&gt;选低阶边缘 加噪]&#10;  A --&gt; G[DP 生成模型]&#10;  B --&gt; G&#10;  C --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt; S[合成数据&lt;br/&gt;继承 DP 保证]&#10;  E[隐私预算 epsilon] -.控制.-&gt; R\">flowchart TD\n  D[真实数据集] --&gt; R{DP 训练路线}\n  R --&gt;|梯度加噪| A[DP-SGD&lt;br/&gt;裁剪+高斯噪声]\n  R --&gt;|教师投票| B[PATE&lt;br/&gt;集成+加噪聚合]\n  R --&gt;|边缘加噪| C[PrivBayes/MST/AIM&lt;br/&gt;选低阶边缘 加噪]\n  A --&gt; G[DP 生成模型]\n  B --&gt; G\n  C --&gt; G\n  G --&gt; S[合成数据&lt;br/&gt;继承 DP 保证]\n  E[隐私预算 epsilon] -.控制.-&gt; R</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span> 取值</th>\n<th>隐私强度</th>\n<th>保真/效用</th>\n<th>典型场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>≈1</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>明显下降</td>\n<td>对外公开、监管发布</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>≈3–5</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>可接受</td>\n<td>跨团队共享</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>≈10</td>\n<td>弱</td>\n<td>较高</td>\n<td>内部低敏感场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>∞（无 DP）</td>\n<td>无保证</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>仅非敏感数据</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>行业经验：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon\\approx1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 提供强保证、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon\\approx10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span> 保证较弱但保真更高（来源：digitalapplied.com《Synthetic Data for LLM Training 2026》）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"路线一-dp-sgd-给梯度加噪\">路线一：DP-SGD——给梯度加噪</h2><p>把 DP 塞进深度生成模型（DP-CTGAN、DP 扩散）最通用的办法是 <strong>DP-SGD</strong>：训练每一步先把每个样本的梯度<strong>裁剪</strong>到有界范数（限制单样本影响力），再加高斯噪声，然后更新。裁剪+加噪保证了每一步是 DP 的，靠组合定理把整个训练的总预算算出来。</p>\n<p>DP-SGD 的优点是通用——任何梯度训练的模型都能套；缺点是噪声在高维梯度上累积，深度模型参数多、训练步数多，预算消耗快，小 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span> 下保真度往往塌得厉害。这正是下面&quot;边缘方法&quot;能反超的原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"路线二-pate-让教师投票\">路线二：PATE——让教师投票</h2><p>PATE（Private Aggregation of Teacher Ensembles）走另一条路：把数据切成若干不相交子集，各训一个&quot;教师&quot;模型；要给学生模型提供监督时，让所有教师投票，并在投票计数上加噪后取多数。因为每个个体只影响一个教师，加噪聚合后单个个体对最终标签的影响被淹没，从而获得 DP。PATE 在有大量无标注公开数据可蒸馏时尤其有效，但对纯生成任务的适配不如 DP-SGD 直接。</p>\n<h2 id=\"路线三-基于边缘的方法-小预算之王\">路线三：基于边缘的方法——小预算之王</h2><p>一个反直觉但重要的事实：在小隐私预算下，<strong>不用深度学习的经典方法常常赢</strong>。PrivBayes、MST、AIM 这类**基于边缘（marginal-based）**的方法思路是：不学完整联合分布，只挑一组低阶边缘（如若干对/三元变量的联合计数），给这些边缘计数加噪，再找一个与这些含噪边缘一致的分布来采样。</p>\n<p>为什么它们赢？因为低阶边缘是<strong>低维统计量</strong>，加同样的噪声相对信号更小、信息损失更少；而深度模型要在高维参数上扛噪声，性价比差。2025 年的差分隐私表格合成基准显示，在严格预算下 MST、AIM 等边缘方法在多数据集上稳定优于 DP 深度模型（来源：arxiv.org/2504.14061《Benchmarking Differentially Private Tabular Data Synthesis》）。这些方法的根基正是 <a href=\"../methods/statistical-simulation\">统计与仿真</a> 里讲的贝叶斯网络——PrivBayes 就是加了 DP 的贝叶斯网络。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一个务实的忠告\">一个务实的忠告</h2><p>DP 不是万能开关。它保证的是&quot;抵御成员/属性推断&quot;这类个体级泄露，但<strong>不能替你解决偏差</strong>——含噪的合成数据仍可能放大训练集偏见，甚至因为小群体样本少、被噪声淹没得更狠，见 <a href=\"../practice/bias-leakage\">偏差与泄漏</a>。选 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span> 也不是越小越好：过小的预算会让效用塌到不可用。正确流程是回到 <a href=\"../foundations/fidelity-utility-privacy\">三角</a>，按场景定隐私优先级，再在可接受的效用底线内选最小可行的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span>。DP 的通用定义与更广的隐私工程见跨库 <a href=\"../../data-ethics-privacy/privacy-engineering/differential-privacy\">数据伦理与隐私 · 差分隐私</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>合成本身不等于隐私安全；未保护的合成器会泄露稀有个体，需差分隐私上数学锁。</li>\n<li>DP 定义为&quot;单个体在不在数据集不显著改变输出分布&quot;，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span> 是隐私预算，具后处理免疫与可组合性。</li>\n<li>三条路线：DP-SGD 给梯度加噪（通用但高维吃亏）、PATE 教师投票、基于边缘的 PrivBayes/MST/AIM。</li>\n<li>小预算下边缘方法常打败 DP 深度模型，因低阶统计量抗噪性价比高。</li>\n<li>DP 不解决偏差，且过小 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span> 会让效用崩塌；须回到三角按场景权衡。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h3><ul>\n<li>兄弟篇：<a href=\"../foundations/fidelity-utility-privacy\">保真-效用-隐私三角</a>、<a href=\"tabular-synthesis\">表格数据合成</a>、<a href=\"../practice/synthetic-evaluation\">保真度评估</a>、<a href=\"../practice/bias-leakage\">偏差与泄漏</a></li>\n<li>跨库：<a href=\"../../data-ethics-privacy/privacy-engineering/differential-privacy\">数据伦理与隐私 · 差分隐私</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"差分隐私合成：给隐私上数学锁","id":"差分隐私合成-给隐私上数学锁"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：差分隐私的定义与预算","id":"核心概念-差分隐私的定义与预算"},{"level":2,"text":"路线一：DP-SGD——给梯度加噪","id":"路线一-dp-sgd-给梯度加噪"},{"level":2,"text":"路线二：PATE——让教师投票","id":"路线二-pate-让教师投票"},{"level":2,"text":"路线三：基于边缘的方法——小预算之王","id":"路线三-基于边缘的方法-小预算之王"},{"level":2,"text":"一个务实的忠告","id":"一个务实的忠告"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":3,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"关系与时序合成：外键完整性与时间自相关","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/synthetic-data-generation/tabular/relational-timeseries"},"next":{"title":"保真度评估：把三角变成可计算的数字","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/synthetic-data-generation/practice/synthetic-evaluation"}}